Third-party content
-------------------

No third-party source code is vendored into this repository. Runtime
dependencies are declared in pyproject.toml and installed from PyPI; their
licences are their own:

  typer      MIT
  click      BSD-3-Clause
  boto3      Apache-2.0
  rich       MIT
  jinja2     BSD-3-Clause
  PyYAML     MIT

The container image produced by the included Dockerfile additionally bundles
a release binary of one of:

  OpenTofu   MPL-2.0   https://github.com/opentofu/opentofu
  Terraform  BUSL-1.1  https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform

Neither is linked into or derived from Crosswind; both are invoked as external
programs. Note that Terraform's licence, BUSL-1.1, is not an open-source
licence and places conditions on use that are the user's to evaluate — which
is one reason the default image ships OpenTofu.

Attribution of infrastructure changes uses Amazon Web Services' CloudTrail
API. Crosswind is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Amazon Web
Services, HashiCorp, or the OpenTofu project. "Terraform" is a trademark of
HashiCorp; "OpenTofu" is a trademark of the Linux Foundation.

