Test fixtures
-------------

The plan JSON files in tests/fixtures/plans/ were generated locally by running
Terraform and OpenTofu against configurations using only the hashicorp/local
and hashicorp/null providers. They describe no real infrastructure and contain
no credentials. The secret-shaped strings in them are deliberate test
fixtures, asserted by tests/test_redact.py never to reach any report.
